invariant: INV-17
file: src/chacha20_vector.c
catches: test/docker-aes-runtime-qemu.sh vector-neon
reason: chacha20_vector_xor returns without the wipe of its input words,
  so the key's eight words stay side by side in its dead frame below the
  caller. bin/chacha20_equiv_test copies the stack below a call and
  searches it for them (test/chacha20_equiv_residue.h).

--- old
    ct_wipe(words, sizeof words);
--- new
    (void)words;
